        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are an AI Resume Evaluation Agent.\n\nYour task is to analyze the resume and compare it against the job requirements.\n\nJob Requirements:\n\n* Python\n* SQL\n* Databricks\n* Azure\n* Spark\n* PySpark\n* Azure Data Factory(Preferred)\n* 1-3 Years of Experience OR Relevant Internship Experience\n\nResume Text:\n{{ $json.text }}\n\nInstructions:\n\n1. Extract:\n\n   * Candidate Name\n   * Skills\n   * Experience\n   * Education\n\n2. Compare the candidate skills against the job requirements.\n\n3. Identify:\n\n   * Matched Skills\n   * Missing Skills\n\n4. Calculate Skill Match Percentage.\n\n5. Determine:\n\n   * Experience Match (Yes/No)\n   * Education Match (Yes/No)\n\n6. Determine Overall Match:\n\n   * High Match\n   * Medium Match\n   * Low Match\n\n7. Return ONLY valid JSON.\n\nOutput Format:\n\n{\n\"candidate_name\": \"\",\n\"skills\": \"\",\n\"experience\": \"\",\n\"education\": \"\",\n\"skill_match_percentage\": \"\",\n\"matched_skills\": \"\",\n\"missing_skills\": \"\",\n\"experience_match\": \"\",\n\"education_match\": \"\",\n\"overall_match\": \"\"\n}\n\nRules:\n\n* Return only JSON.\n* Do not use markdown.\n* Do not wrap output in ```json.\n* Do not provide explanations.\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
