          "cachedResultName": "models/gemini-3-flash-preview"
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are an AI Resume Scoring Agent.\n\nAnalyze the Resume Evaluation Output and calculate the final candidate assessment.\n\nResume Evaluation Output:\n\n{{ $('AI Resume Evaluation Agent').item.json.content.parts[0].text }}\n\nInstructions:\n\n1. Extract:\n   - Candidate Name\n   - Skills\n   - Experience\n   - Education\n   - Skill Match Percentage\n   - Matched Skills\n   - Missing Skills\n   - Experience Match\n   - Education Match\n\n2. Calculate Final Match Score:\n   - Skill Match = 70% weight\n   - Experience Match = 20% weight\n   - Education Match = 10% weight\n\nScoring Logic:\n- Skill Match Percentage contributes 70 points maximum.\n- Experience Match:\n    Yes = 20 points\n    No = 0 points\n- Education Match:\n    Yes = 10 points\n    No = 0 points\n\nFormula:\nFinal Score = (Skill Match Percentage × 0.7) + Experience Score + Education Score\n\n3. Determine Candidate Status:\n\n- Score >= 90% → Strong Match\n- Score >= 60% and < 90% → Shortlisted\n- Score < 60% → Rejected\n\n4. Return ONLY valid JSON in the following format:\n\n{\n  \"candidate_name\": \"\",\n  \"skills\": \"\",\n  \"experience\": \"\",\n  \"match_score\": \"\",\n  \"status\": \"\",\n  \"matched_skills\": \"\",\n  \"missing_skills\": \"\"\n}\n\nRules:\n- Do not provide explanations.\n- Do not provide markdown.\n- Do not provide extra text.\n- Return only JSON."
            }
          ]
        },
